   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reinforce HIA and international cooperation for WH sustainable management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Viet Nam has been an active Member State of UNESCO and prioritize its strategy and resources in promoting the UNESCO World Heritage Convention and other UNESCO frameworks identifying, protecting and managing the country&apos;s tangible heritages. Given the recent rapid economic development in WH areas, the country priority is to reinforce the Heritage Impact Assessment, build capacity for site managers and facilitate the international cooperation to advise proper development in balance with protecting the properties&apos; OUVs.</narrative>
